{"seq":6,"slug":"ecological-civilization","title":"生态文明建设","stage":"DONE","category":"xi-jinping-thought","categoryLabel":"习近平思想","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/03_xi-jinping-thought/06_ecological-civilization","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生态文明建设-简介\">生态文明建设 简介</h1><p>本 hub 是&quot;习近平生态文明思想&quot;的专题研究单元，覆盖一个完整的问题闭环：一套思想如何被提出（理论）、如何变成可执行的约束（制度）、最终在现实中留下了什么（实践）。与泛泛的&quot;环保知识&quot;不同，这里的每一篇都坚持三件事——把论断还原到具体日期与文件、用数据核验官方叙事、同时记录批评者与第三方的声音。读完本 hub，你应当能够独立评估&quot;生态文明&quot;从口号到治理体系的全过程，而不是复述宣传要点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>讲什么</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01 思想概览</td>\n<td>习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想全景（十四个坚持）</td>\n<td>那里是地图，这里是其中&quot;生态文明&quot;一个区域的等高线详图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02 国家治理</td>\n<td>治理体系与治理能力的一般框架</td>\n<td>本 hub 只取其在生态领域的具体化（督察、河长制、红线），不展开一般治理理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04 新发展理念</td>\n<td>创新、协调、绿色、开放、共享的经济学含义</td>\n<td>&quot;绿色&quot;理念在两山论中的理论形态归本 hub，其宏观经济政策面归彼处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>05 一带一路</td>\n<td>倡议的政治经济全景</td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲绿色维度（停建海外煤电、绿色金融），不重复地缘经济分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>07 人类命运共同体</td>\n<td>全球秩序观与外交理念</td>\n<td>本 hub 只在气候与生物多样性外交处与之相接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按&quot;理论→制度→实践&quot;的三章顺序阅读是最稳的路径：第 1 章给出概念工具（两山论、生态马克思主义、生命共同体），第 2 章展示这些理念如何被翻译成法律、指标与组织机制，第 3 章用数据检验前两章的承诺。时间有限的读者可以走一条最短路径：<a href=\"theoretical-framework/two-mountains-theory\">两山论</a> → <a href=\"institutional-system/carbon-neutrality\">双碳目标</a> → <a href=\"practice-achievement/pollution-control\">污染防治攻坚战</a>，这三篇构成理解当代中国环境治理的最小骨架。政策研究者则建议直接从第 2 章切入，那里对制度机制的拆解（激励函数、委托代理、指标博弈）最密集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 不需要环境科学专业背景，但三组常识会让体验顺畅许多：一是当代中国史的基本脉络（改革开放、十八大以来的政策节奏），二是几个高频环境指标的直观含义（PM2.5、碳排放强度、水质类别），三是基础的制度概念（五年规划、中央与地方关系）。文中涉及的少量公式（如承载力方程、净排放恒等式）均为初等数学，且都配有文字解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>若想继续扩展，可前往同 collection 的兄弟 hub：<a href=\"../xi-jinping-thought-overview/\">思想概览</a>提供全景坐标，<a href=\"../new-development-philosophy/\">新发展理念</a>补充绿色理念的经济学面，<a href=\"../belt-and-road-initiative/\">一带一路</a>提供绿色议题的政治经济背景。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-framework","title":"理论框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/theoretical-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-mountains-theory","title":"两山论：从余村论断到生态产品价值实现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/theoretical-framework/two-mountains-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ecological-marxism","title":"生态马克思主义：理论谱系与中国对话","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/theoretical-framework/ecological-marxism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"holistic-view","title":"生命共同体：山水林田湖草沙的系统观","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/theoretical-framework/holistic-view"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"institutional-system","title":"制度体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/institutional-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"environmental-protection-law","title":"环境法治体系：从试行法到最严格制度","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/institutional-system/environmental-protection-law"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-neutrality","title":"双碳目标：承诺结构、政策体系与现实张力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/institutional-system/carbon-neutrality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"river-chief-system","title":"河长制：属地责任的水治理机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/institutional-system/river-chief-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"practice-achievement","title":"实践成就","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/practice-achievement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pollution-control","title":"污染防治攻坚战：三大保卫战的数据核验","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/practice-achievement/pollution-control"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biodiversity-protection","title":"生物多样性保护：从物种抢救到三十乘三十","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/practice-achievement/biodiversity-protection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"green-belt-road","title":"绿色\"一带一路\"：从煤电争议到转型试验","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/ecological-civilization/practice-achievement/green-belt-road"}]}]}